msgstr ""

msgid "Import ▸ Table with a mapping…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Read a table or an XML through a mapping: into a new graph, or onto this "
"one"
msgstr ""

msgid "Export ▸"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Export the current document. Installed plugins add their commands here, "
"after the rows below."
msgstr ""

msgid "Export ▸ SVG"
msgstr ""

msgid "Export the current view as SVG"
msgstr ""

msgid "Export ▸ Turtle (.ttl)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Export as RDF/CIDOC Turtle (.ttl) via the s3Dgraphy projection"
msgstr ""

msgid "Export ▸ Blender scene (.blend)…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"A working .blend for Blender from what there is on the disk or in the "
"room, with no .blend to start from: a working profile, the containers or "
"epochs; each object carries the graph's tags"
msgstr ""

msgid "Export ▸ Consolidate for…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Archive › Assets for a target: each asset with its versions and textures,"
" what Heriverse, ATON, the web or a phone will load, what is to do, the "
"scene's bars against the bands, the queue. Nothing is written until an "
"action of the queue runs."
msgstr ""

msgid "Export ▸ Print sheets…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Print the recording sheets of the graph: all, the selection, or those the"
" criteria keep (type, epoch, activity, state, numbers, words)"
msgstr ""

msgid "External data ▸"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The files the study points to: find the missing ones, collect them into "
"the project, open its folder."
msgstr ""

msgid "External data ▸ Find missing files…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Look in a folder you choose for the files this document cannot find — by "
"their sha256, else by name and size — and rewrite their paths relative to"
" the em.json. One undo."
msgstr ""

msgid "External data ▸ Collect resources…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Copy into the study's folder the files it names outside it (absolute "
"paths, onedrive://, a .blend elsewhere) — only what each needs, every "
"copy checked by sha256 — and rewrite their paths relative to the em.json."
" Never a move; one undo."
msgstr ""

msgid "External data ▸ Open the project folder"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Opens the root of the active .em.json's project (the folder that holds "
"EM/) in the Finder / Explorer / file manager (in a browser alone: the "
"path, copied)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Clean up ▸"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Tidy the file and the project: the presentation section out of the file, "
"the folders by the standard."
msgstr ""

msgid "Clean up ▸ Clean the file…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Take out of the em.json what is only a way of looking at it (the colour "
"schemes), after showing what goes. The graphs do not change. One undo."
msgstr ""

msgid "Clean up ▸ Reorder by the standard…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Shows the plan for the open project's folder (the folders to make, the "
"files to move) and asks"
msgstr ""

msgid "Room ▸"
msgstr ""

msgid "Work together on a node: create a room, or bring this file into a new one."
msgstr ""

msgid "Room ▸ Create a room…"
msgstr ""

msgid "A room on this node, yours, empty. Whoever creates it is its owner."
msgstr ""

msgid "Room ▸ Bring this into a new room…"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Put the graph you have open on a table on this node. From that moment the"
" live copy is the node's."
msgstr ""

